{"id":"vod_hh_86981","vodId":"86981","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"排球少年","name_cn":"排球少年","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第25集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/b45af050c77a2e9e7a77db853e89d603.jpg"},"summary":"童年时一次看电视转播的经历，在少年日向翔阳（村濑步 配音）的心中种下了排球的种子。他在初中时代是排球部的主将，可是人丁寥落的排球部始终没有起色，唯一一场比赛也以惨败告终。在此之后，他终于如愿考入梦寐以求的学府乌野高中，并加入了该校的排球部。当年翔阳在电视上看到的正是乌野 高中的比赛，如今这个学校的排球却正面临着衰败的命运。与宿命的对手和好友影山飞雄（石川界人 配音）聚首于此，心怀排球梦想的少年们将团结一心，带领着乌野这名王者再度振翅高飞……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-09-19 18:06:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/xboqNWAe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/neggBWDe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/neggBWZe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Le35oq9b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QbYGk9Oe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mbkmJ0re/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9avAXMMe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/NbWDgEnd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/oeE5NL4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/vbmoLzne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Pe95xzYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/7axDZWEa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QdJmV99b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/6dB5KMWb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/0dNqZoNb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Qe18mN0d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ZdPv2Vya/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/6dB5K